ne{1000 \ldots0} + \underbrace{0.0\ldots 0}_{\text{last digit deleted}} \Rightarrow a = n \times (\text{original number}) + \text{that last digit} \div a \cdots \text{Since the last digit is 0 or 1, the last piece after dividing by } a \, \text{ is also divisible by } a \cdots \, \text{ so, } \\ \overline{1000} \, \text{is divisible by } a \cdots \, \text{See division (in precalculus). }
